    "notes": [
      "Palette capped at 8 census clusters; dropped: #e8e8e8 (border, 98), #0fc0fc40 (25% skyblue tint, surface, 67), #1e1e1ebf (75% black overlay, 80), #545454 (12), #1e1e1e80 (6), #ffffff80 (1).",
      "Census did not register #ff4571 ('flower') because it is painted as an SVG currentColor fill (.Bubble.color-flower{color:#ff4571}); it colours 9 NumberFact bubbles on en/de-de/ch-de and is visually prominent in the en screenshot. Also defined but not in census: #ff8000 tangerine, #09fbd3 mint (KeyFact illustrations; mint is the dark-theme button hover).",
      "Census aggregate.logo.source='none'; the logo was located as <img> in header a.Topbar--logo (en.html) and downloaded.",
      "Census iconFont families=['swiper-icons'] with 0 glyphs used — swiper carousel arrow font, not a brand icon font; site icons are inline SVG sprites. iconFont set to null.",
      "No home-vs-cross-page radius divergence: 12px is both count mode and area mode.",
      "EN home (en) has no <h1>: hero headline 'What is Fairtrade?' is an h2 slide title; de-de/ch-de landings carry an h1 in a PageLead band.",
      "Heading type scale: computed levels h1 72 → h2 48 → h3 32 → h4 20; CSS utility scale .t-headline-xxl..xxs is 56/48/40/32/24/20/16 (8px steps at desktop).",
      "Brand-review --primary resolves (per template colour-resolution rule: saturated & max channel <240) to #7b1dab eggplant because skyblue #0fc0fc and leafgreen #d4ff47 exceed max-channel 240; the live site's visual anchors are skyblue and leafgreen.",
      "voiceTable.ctaFrequency excludes header/footer chrome labels (nav items, footer links, aria-suffixed buttons; any non-closed-list label on ≥3 pages); raw top entries were footer links (Impressum, Instagram, LinkedIn ×9). Closed-list labels are always kept.",
      "Spacing scale read from site.css declaration frequency (padding/gap/margin), not from the census (census carries no spacing histogram); containerMaxWidth and gridGap not measured."
    ]
